  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Community Development project design</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to encourage DPA to adopt some good practices in project design specifically for Integrated Community Development with the Indigenous communities. It is also to increase communities&apos; influence on project design and build ownership and control over the project. It is expected that by the end of the this six-month project, DPA will be able to demonstrate quality project proposal that clearly links learnings and builds upon progress on projects that they have implemented in Mondulkiri and Ratanakiri communities. The project will then have clear documentation on baseline, M&amp;E framework so that evidence of changes becomes concrete.</narrative>
  </description>
